// E1103: `"Allc"` is not in the table of §8.2, each element as its own: a name outside the table is not counted
// for a repetition, so the second is the same E1103 as the first, not one more (§15.3 `provides`; S-831 A3).

pub fn f() -> I32 { 1 }
